  </fr:frontmatter>
  <fr:mainmatter>
    <html:p><fr:link href="/lasserCoStarVerifiedALL2021/" title="CoStar: A verified ALL(*) parser" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/lasserCoStarVerifiedALL2021/" display-uri="lasserCoStarVerifiedALL2021" type="local">CoStar</fr:link> mentions several critical vulnerabilites that follow from faulty parser.</html:p>
