        <fr:display-uri>sss-002Q</fr:display-uri>
        <fr:route>/sss-002Q/</fr:route>
        <fr:title text="Cloudflare Parsing Error">Cloudflare Parsing Error</fr:title>
        <fr:meta name="external">https://project-zero.issues.chromium.org/issues/42450151</fr:meta>
      </fr:frontmatter>
      <fr:mainmatter>
        <html:p>An error in the Cloudflare HTML parser would allow unintialized memory to be dumped when there were imbalanced HTML tags.</html:p>
        <html:p>This is indeed a case where a verified parser would have alleviated the issue.</html:p>
      </fr:mainmatter>
